      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Text m\u011Bsta Dunera",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kultista\n\u0022Mus\u00EDme si posp\u00ED\u0161it, pane! Ten mudrc nesm\u00ED uzav\u0159\u00EDt br\u00E1nu - mus\u00EDme Bethrezena osvobodit!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner T30",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "R\u00E1dce\n\u0022Pane! Na\u0161i zv\u011Bdov\u00E9 zahl\u00E9dli, jak se k br\u00E1n\u011B bl\u00ED\u017E\u00ED Gymner! Ka\u017Edou chv\u00EDli zah\u00E1j\u00ED ob\u0159ad, kter\u00FD zpe\u010Det\u00ED n\u00E1\u0161 osud! To se nesm\u00ED st\u00E1t!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN0029",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leif",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vstup do oblasti 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kopcov\u00FD obr\n\u0022Wotan nedopust\u00ED takov\u00E9 rouh\u00E1n\u00ED! P\u0159ipravte se na cestu k va\u0161emu proklat\u00E9mu bohu!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vstup do oblasti 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kopcov\u00FD obr\n\u0022Wotan nedopust\u00ED, abyste svou p\u0159\u00EDtomnost\u00ED poskvrnili na\u0161e zem\u011B, vy odpadl\u00E1 verbe\u017Ei! Povede n\u00E1s k v\u00EDt\u011Bzstv\u00ED nad va\u0161imi vojsky!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Opil\u00ED trpasl\u00EDci",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Str\u00E1\u017Ece Thurin\n\u0022Ha! Pro\u010D sem pos\u00EDlaj\u00ED Gymnera? Takhle pro\u0161vihneme lov na troly v Gunthe\u0159e...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Trpasl\u00EDk\n\u0022Pche! Kdo v\u00ED? M\u00E1me pr\u00FD Gymnera hl\u00EDdat p\u0159i n\u011Bjak\u00E9m ob\u0159adu. A ostatn\u00ED se v\u017Edycky m\u016F\u017Eou bavit!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Str\u00E1\u017Ece Thurin\n\u0022Tak mi je\u0161t\u011B nalej! M\u016F\u017Eeme si taky trochu u\u017E\u00EDt, i kdy\u017E hl\u00EDd\u00E1me tuhle zatracenou br\u00E1nu!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kultista\n\u0022Narazili jsme na opil\u00E9 trpasl\u00EDky, pane. St\u0159e\u017E\u00ED cestu, je\u017E vede k br\u00E1n\u011B!!!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Varov\u00E1n\u00ED p\u0159ed gobliny 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kultista\n\u0022Tato oblast je zamo\u0159ena gobliny, pane! Nev\u00EDme jist\u011B, jak\u00E1 dal\u0161\u00ED stvo\u0159en\u00ED je je\u0161t\u011B prov\u00E1zej\u00ED. Na ka\u017Ed\u00FD p\u00E1d mus\u00EDme b\u00FDt opatrn\u00ED.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Posl\u00E1n\u00ED spln\u011Bno",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "V\u00E9voda\n\u0022Splnili jsme sv\u016Fj \u00FAkol, pane. Mudrc Gymner je mrtv\u00FD.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Str\u00E1\u017Ece oblak\n\u0022J\u00E1... jsem pora\u017Een. M\u016Fj... Mo... Morok mne pomst\u00ED. Po... poc\u00EDt\u00EDte hn\u011Bv v\u0161ech kmen\u016F!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "D\u00E9monolog\n\u0022Pohle\u010F! Br\u00E1na se otv\u00EDr\u00E1! Bethrezen bude kone\u010Dn\u011B voln\u00FD! N\u00E1\u0161 p\u00E1n se k n\u00E1m vrac\u00ED!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "D\u00E9monolog\n\u0022Co... co je to?!! Chlapec? Kde je ten mocn\u00FD d\u00E9mon, jen\u017E velel arm\u00E1d\u00E1m pekeln\u00FDm? Kam se pod\u011Bl Bethrezen, kdy\u017E tu nen\u00ED uv\u011Bzn\u011Bn? Copak na n\u00E1s n\u00E1\u0161 p\u00E1n za tu dobu, co jsme na n\u011Bj \u010Dekali, zapomn\u011Bl?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pomoc nemrtv\u00FDch",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Temn\u00FD \u010Darod\u011Bj\n\u0022Pane, Z\u00E1stupy nemrtv\u00FDch pou\u017Eily na Gymnera sv\u00E9 um\u011Bn\u00ED. Maj\u00ED se pokusit pomoci n\u00E1m zachr\u00E1nit Bethrezena? Co je jejich \u00FAkolem?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Str\u00E1\u017Ece oblak\n\u0022Marn\u011B se mne pokou\u0161\u00EDte zastavit! Kmeny si nenechaj\u00ED zk\u0159\u00ED\u017Eit pl\u00E1ny a v\u00E1\u0161 proklat\u00FD b\u016Fh bude uv\u011Bzn\u011Bn nav\u011Bky...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Temn\u00FD \u010Darod\u011Bj\n\u0022Gymner u\u017E zah\u00E1jil ob\u0159ad! Mus\u00EDme ude\u0159it ihned - tla\u010D\u00ED n\u00E1s \u010Das!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN0030",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T1 varov\u00E1n\u00ED",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Trpasl\u00EDk\n\u0022Co\u017Ee to?! D\u00E9moni - a tady?! T\u00E1hn\u011Bte odsud, ne\u017E v\u00E1s zni\u010D\u00EDme! Toto je \u00FAzem\u00ED horsk\u00FDch kmen\u016F - opus\u0165te je, dokud m\u016F\u017Eete!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kultista\n\u0022Pane, zabijeme toho trpasli\u010D\u00EDho posla, ne\u017E varuje v\u0161echny ostatn\u00ED a prozrad\u00ED n\u00E1s? Mus\u00EDme ho zastavit!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Trpasli\u010D\u00ED posel",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "R\u00E1dce\n\u0022Trpasli\u010D\u00ED posel u\u017E dorazil do c\u00EDle, pane. Ob\u00E1v\u00E1m se, \u017Ee kmeny o n\u00E1s u\u017E v\u00ED!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Posl\u00E1n\u00ED spln\u011Bno",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bethrezen\n\u0022Copak mne nepozn\u00E1v\u00E1\u0161? Padni na kolena p\u0159ed vl\u00E1dcem pekel!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zni\u010Den\u00ED str\u00E1\u017Ee 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "R\u00E1dce\n\u0022Chytili a zabili jsme str\u00E1\u017E - br\u00E1na u\u017E nem\u016F\u017Ee b\u00FDt daleko! Mus\u00EDme si d\u00E1vat pozor na nep\u0159\u00E1tele; \u010D\u00EDm v\u00EDc se p\u0159ibl\u00ED\u017E\u00EDme k br\u00E1n\u011B, t\u00EDm sp\u00ED\u0161 naraz\u00EDme na odpor...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Trpasli\u010D\u00ED tah",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Trpasli\u010D\u00ED str\u00E1\u017E\n\u0022T\u00E1hn\u011Bte, netvo\u0159i! Zloduchov\u00E9 jako vy tudy nesm\u00ED proj\u00EDt! Zmizte, nebo zhy\u0148te!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Trpasli\u010D\u00ED posel zabit",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "R\u00E1dce\n\u0022Pane, poda\u0159ilo se n\u00E1m zab\u00EDt posla! Jestli se zbav\u00EDme kr\u00E1lova syna d\u0159\u00EDv, ne\u017E stihne uzav\u0159\u00EDt pekelnou br\u00E1nu, Bethrezen bude voln\u00FD!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Osvobo\u010F obry",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Posl\u00E1n\u00ED selhalo",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Str\u00E1\u017Ece oblak\n\u0022Ha, ha, ha! Ob\u0159ad byl dokon\u010Den! Nyn\u00ED br\u00E1na z\u016Fstane uzav\u0159ena po cel\u00E9 dal\u0161\u00ED stolet\u00ED!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner T40",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kultista\n\u0022Tady! Do\u0161la zpr\u00E1va od Gymnera!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Trpasli\u010D\u00ED posel\n\u0022Opus\u0165te tuto zemi, podl\u00E9 bestie! Nikdy se v\u00E1m nepoda\u0159\u00ED zastavit Gymner\u016Fv ob\u0159ad! Bethrezen\u016Fv osud u\u017E je zpe\u010Det\u011Bn!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zpr\u00E1va T8",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "R\u00E1dce\n\u0022Ti zabedn\u011Bn\u00ED trpasl\u00EDci o n\u00E1s snad v\u016Fbec nemaj\u00ED potuchy, pane. M\u011Bli bychom vyu\u017E\u00EDt situace!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner T70",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Str\u00E1\u017Ece oblak\n\u0022V\u0161e je pro v\u00E1s ztraceno, d\u00E9moni. Br\u00E1na u\u017E je skoro uzav\u0159ena. A\u017E dokon\u010D\u00EDme ob\u0159ad, postar\u00E1m se i o v\u00E1s!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kultista\n\u0022Posp\u011B\u0161, pane! Jestli se to Gymnerovi poda\u0159\u00ED, zahyneme!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN004f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mistrovsk\u00FD lupi\u010D",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
